{"version":2,"sourceHash":"8ba562241517e1e324fbb5326f4ec69210a15b0a6dae5c333b57fe04c2e0c36e","locale":"zh-CN","id":"ep-45","no":"EP.45","tag":"第45话 · 月亮与太阳","title":"月亮与太阳","rev":2,"beats":[{"id":"ep-45:1","s":"n","t":"十八号牌，月亮。天空挂着两轮月，一轮泛着冷光，另一轮黑得像它的影子。","bg":"clearMoonWater","tone":"dark","bgm":"midnightPulse","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"serious"},"c":{"who":"pje","x":"serious"},"r":{"who":"yun","x":"serious"},"sfx":"whoosh","scene":{"background":"clearMoonWater","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: clearMoonWater","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"clearMoonWater 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-45:2","s":"n","t":"路两侧各立着一座塔。远处狗与狼轮流嚎叫，直到最后也辨不清哪边才是狗。"},{"id":"ep-45:3","s":"yun","t":"月亮牌只有一个规则，别相信眼见的一切。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:4","s":"moka","t":"那信什么？闭眼走吗？","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:5","s":"yun","t":"相信彼此。牵住手，叫名字，确认有没有回应。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-45:6","s":"n","t":"Yeoni摸了摸口袋里的备忘本。纸角碰到指尖，光是这样，就稍稍安心了。"},{"id":"ep-45:7","s":"yeon","t":"（认不得站在我这边的人的脸，但认得记着他的字。这样就够了。）","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-45:8","s":"n","t":"每个水洼都映着月亮，也映着Yeoni。她停下脚步，水里的她却慢半拍才停。"},{"id":"ep-45:9","s":"yeon","t":"那家伙一直在学我，可总是慢一点。","x":"fear","im":true,"fx":"veil","sfx":"glitch","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"clearMoonWater","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: clearMoonWater","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"veil","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"clearMoonWater 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:10","s":"pje","t":"别看，绕过水洼，不要踩。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:11","s":"n","t":"这时雾落了下来，从脚踝到膝盖，再从膝盖到肩膀，只在一瞬间。"},{"id":"ep-45:12","s":"moka","t":"喂，手！牵住手！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:13","s":"n","t":"Yeoni伸出手，指尖擦过什么，又错失了。雾里，大家的声音越来越远。"},{"id":"ep-45:14","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨撑开伞站着。缠着胶带的伞骨推开少许雾气，身旁只剩闰月。","bg":"clearMoonWater","tone":"dark","bgm":"zeroPoint","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"pje","x":"serious"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"yun","x":"serious"},"sfx":"none","scene":{"background":"clearMoonWater","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: clearMoonWater","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"clearMoonWater 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-45:15","s":"yun","t":"摩卡和Yeoni去了另一边，听声音是这样。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:16","s":"pje","t":"不是说这张牌里，声音也不能信吗？","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:17","s":"yun","t":"对，所以现在我的话也只信一半吧。","x":"sly"},{"id":"ep-45:18","s":"n","t":"雾的另一头传来脚步声。先看见黄色书包，然后是Yeoni的脸。"},{"id":"ep-45:19","s":"yeon","t":"寒雨！找到你了，闰月先生也在。","x":"smile","c":{"who":"yeon","x":"smile"}},{"id":"ep-45:20","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨刚想向前迈半步，又停住。Yeoni的运动鞋是干的，明明经过了那么多水洼。"},{"id":"ep-45:21","s":"pje","t":"摩卡先生呢？","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-45:22","s":"yeon","t":"在那边走散了。不过先别说那个，寒雨，我刚才一直在想。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-45:23","s":"yeon","t":"Neo被吞掉，不都是因为你吗？","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:24","s":"n","t":"雾里安静下来，狗和狼都不叫了。"},{"id":"ep-45:25","s":"pje","t":"Yeoni。","x":"waver","im":true,"shot":"impact","sfx":"heartbeat","scene":{"background":"clearMoonWater","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: clearMoonWater","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"clearMoonWater 배경에서 진행되는 pje의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:26","s":"yeon","t":"第一个春天不也是你吗？门是你打开的。这次你站在前面，Neo却还是被吃了。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:27","s":"yun","t":"Yeoni，那是……","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:28","s":"yeon","t":"闰月先生别插手，这是我们两个的事。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:29","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨的伞尖颤抖着。嘴唇动了动，想回答，却没有声音。那句话，正是她每晚写在账本上的话。"},{"id":"ep-45:30","s":"pje","t":"是，所以我想偿还……","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-45:31","s":"yeon","t":"那就先把伞给我，那个本来就是我的。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-45:32","s":"n","t":"雨开始下了，是月光里的雨。这时另一串脚步穿破雾气奔来。啪嗒、啪嗒，径直踩进水洼的声音。","bg":"clearMoonWater","tone":"dark","shot":"close","sfx":"rain","scene":{"background":"clearMoonWater","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: clearMoonWater","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"clearMoonWater 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-45:33","s":"n","t":"第二个Yeoni出现了，从头到运动鞋全湿透，膝盖留着摔倒的痕迹。摩卡气喘吁吁地跟在后面。"},{"id":"ep-45:34","s":"moka","t":"那是什么！怎么有两个Yeoni！","x":"angry","im":true,"fx":"shake","sfx":"thud","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"clearMoonWater","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: clearMoonWater","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"shake","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"clearMoonWater 배경에서 진행되는 moka의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:35","s":"yun","t":"啊，这下连信一半都不行了。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-45:36","s":"n","t":"湿透的Yeoni看着干燥的Yeoni，干燥的也看着湿透的。两张脸一模一样，连眼下的浮肿也一样。"},{"id":"ep-45:37","s":"yeon","t":"你是什么东西，用我的脸做什么？","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:38","s":"yeon","t":"这才是我想问的。寒雨，她是假的。记得刚才在水洼里笑的那个吧？","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-45:39","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨轮流看着两人。干燥的Yeoni那笑容很熟悉，熟悉得让她窒息。"},{"id":"ep-45:40","s":"yun","t":"来核实一下。Yeoni的出生年月日时。","x":"serious","bg":"clearMoonWater","tone":"dark","shot":"wide","scene":{"background":"clearMoonWater","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: clearMoonWater","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"clearMoonWater 배경에서 진행되는 yun의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-45:41","s":"yeon","t":"二〇〇二年七月六日，八点半，乙亥日柱。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-45:42","s":"yeon","t":"没错，是我。可她也知道啊！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:43","s":"yun","t":"两个都答对了。黑月吞食命式，靠数字分不出来。","x":"sly"},{"id":"ep-45:44","s":"moka","t":"那我来。Yeoni，第一次给我打几颗星？","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:45","s":"yeon","t":"两颗，因为那味道简直犯罪。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-45:46","s":"yeon","t":"两颗！不是吧，连这个也知道？","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:47","s":"moka","t":"这也都答对了，真要疯了。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:48","s":"n","t":"雨更大了。湿透的Yeoni牙齿打颤。干燥的Yeoni淋着雨，却一点不湿。没有人冷静到能指出这一点。"},{"id":"ep-45:49","s":"heuk","t":"反正是同一张脸啊，雨水。第一个春天，你不也选不出来吗？"},{"id":"ep-45:50","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨抬起头。那个声音，是从车站长椅后传来、第一次把账本交给她的声音。","bg":"clearMoonWater","tone":"dark","shot":"close","sfx":"rain","scene":{"background":"clearMoonWater","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: clearMoonWater","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"clearMoonWater 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-45:51","s":"pje","t":"那时选不了。这次我可以选。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:52","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨收起伞。雨直接浇到她头上，冰凉的雨水渗入大衣内侧。"},{"id":"ep-45:53","s":"n","t":"干燥的Yeoni伸出手，伸向徐寒雨手里的伞。","im":true,"shot":"impact","sfx":"none","scene":{"background":"clearMoonWater","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: clearMoonWater","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"clearMoonWater 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:54","s":"yeon","t":"做得好，拿过来吧，那是我的。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-45:55","s":"n","t":"湿透的Yeoni也动了，牙齿打颤，踉跄着走向徐寒雨。然后举起书包遮住她的头，自己的头却依旧淋在雨里。"},{"id":"ep-45:56","s":"yeon","t":"傻瓜，为什么收伞，会感冒的。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:57","s":"n","t":"雨水沿黄色书包分开，徐寒雨头上有了一小片屋顶，笨拙、歪斜，只有一半。","im":true,"fx":"water","sfx":"water","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"clearMoonWater","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: clearMoonWater","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"water","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"clearMoonWater 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:58","s":"pje","t":"真正的Yeoni会先递伞，不会开口要。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-45:59","s":"pje","t":"没有伞，拿书包也会。","x":"resolve"},{"id":"ep-45:60","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨转向干燥的Yeoni，收起的伞尖对准了她的胸口。"},{"id":"ep-45:61","s":"pje","t":"把那张脸摘下来。那不是你有资格拥有的脸。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:62","s":"n","t":"干燥的Yeoni仍笑着，脸却裂开了。缝隙里透出黑光，嘴角裂到了耳边。","bg":"eclipseSky","tone":"dark","bgm":"crisis2","shot":"impact","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"sfx":"glitch","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-45:63","s":"heuk","t":"可惜，本想这次多用一阵。","im":true,"fx":"hands","sfx":"glitch","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"hands","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 heuk의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:64","s":"n","t":"脸一片片脱落，下面空无一物。只有一个黑圆吞着月光，正是两轮月中漆黑的那轮。"},{"id":"ep-45:65","s":"heuk","t":"但没关系。在月亮牌里，我能变成任何人，你们的妈妈、朋友，还有那只猫。"},{"id":"ep-45:66","s":"n","t":"雾里浮现Yeoni、徐寒雨和摩卡的脸。后面还有一个银发、穿深蓝衣服的人。"},{"id":"ep-45:67","s":"yeon","t":"Neo。","x":"fear"},{"id":"ep-45:68","s":"n","t":"名字先脱口而出。明明想不起是谁，一看到银色衣摆，指尖就发颤。"},{"id":"ep-45:69","s":"yun","t":"Yeoni，那是假的。真正的他衣服没那么完整。为了遮住受伤的手臂，袖口早都磨破了。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:70","s":"yeon","t":"怎么现在才告诉我，这样不是更想见他了。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-45:71","s":"moka","t":"够了，都让开。对付谎言就用火。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:72","s":"n","t":"摩卡擦燃火柴，把剩下的两根一起划亮。火焰从指间长大，冲向天空。","bg":"siksang5","bgm":"fireFestival","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"surprise"},"c":{"who":"moka","x":"base"},"r":{"who":"pje","x":"surprise"},"sfx":"fire","scene":{"background":"siksang5","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang5","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang5 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-45:73","s":"n","t":"太阳升起来了。十九号牌，太阳。雾瞬间燃烧，藏在月光里的脸像纸一样卷曲消失。","im":true,"fx":"fire","sfx":"fire","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"siksang5","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang5","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"fire","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang5 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:74","s":"n","t":"睁开眼，众人站在熟悉的舞台上，上方挂着正午太阳。太阳牌里的世界，很像摩卡的岛。"},{"id":"ep-45:75","s":"moka","t":"我们岛啊，太阳回来那天的舞台。","x":"moved"},{"id":"ep-45:76","s":"yeon","t":"摩卡原来真是太阳，两根火柴就升起一轮太阳。","x":"happy"},{"id":"ep-45:77","s":"moka","t":"意思是，两根都用完了。我现在两手空空，你们负责。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:78","s":"pje","t":"要记账吗？两根火柴，未收款。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-45:79","s":"moka","t":"你不是说那本账写不了了吗！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-45:80","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨没回答，甩了甩湿发，向Yeoni伸出手。Yeoni握住了，两个人都还湿着。"},{"id":"ep-45:81","s":"yeon","t":"寒雨，谢谢你刚才那句话。不过我也糊涂了，差点以为那个才是我。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-45:82","s":"pje","t":"我也分不清，笑起来一模一样。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-45:83","s":"yeon","t":"那你凭什么选的？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-45:84","s":"pje","t":"湿的那一边。Yeoni总是在淋湿的那一边。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-45:85","s":"n","t":"太阳牌的舞台后有一道敞开的门，门后传来号角声。二十号牌，审判。","bg":"fateTarot","bgm":"fortuneReveal","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"serious"},"c":{"who":"yun","x":"serious"},"r":{"who":"pje","x":"base"},"sfx":"bell","scene":{"background":"fateTarot","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: fateTarot","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"fateTarot 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-45:86","s":"n","t":"天空的天使每吹一次号，地上就浮起一个名字，都是被黑月吞掉的名字。但它们又沉下去，因为没人呼唤。"},{"id":"ep-45:87","s":"yun","t":"审判是呼唤之牌，有人呼唤，名字才会起身。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:88","s":"yeon","t":"那我来叫不就好了。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:89","s":"yun","t":"要认识名字的主人才叫得了。你认识的名字不多，我连自己的名字也不知道。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-45:90","s":"n","t":"闰月握紧戴手套的手，掌心里透出黑色。空亡扩大了一点。"},{"id":"ep-45:91","s":"yeon","t":"你的手，比刚才大了。","x":"sad","im":true,"shot":"close","sfx":"heartbeat","scene":{"background":"fateTarot","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: fateTarot","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"fateTarot 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:92","s":"yun","t":"今天吞了点雾。没事，目前还塞得进手套。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-45:93","s":"n","t":"下一道门是二十一号，世界。圆形月桂环里有人起舞，那是愚者旅程终结的牌。"},{"id":"ep-45:94","s":"yeon","t":"到结尾，就该去黑月那里了？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-45:95","s":"yun","t":"原本在二十一号结束。愚者是零号，所以总共二十二张。但你们看。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:96","s":"n","t":"月桂环下，牌与牌之间有一道窄缝，宽得刚好能放进一张牌。风从缝里漏出来。"},{"id":"ep-45:97","s":"sys","t":"[ 23 · THE DOOR ]","im":true,"fx":"tarot","sfx":"page","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"fateTarot","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: fateTarot","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"tarot","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"fateTarot 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:98","s":"n","t":"文字在缝上浮起，又消失了。Yeoni见过那些字，第一晚的房间里，在这一切开始之前。"},{"id":"ep-45:99","s":"yeon","t":"那扇门，我认识，在我房间里的。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-45:100","s":"n","t":"缝隙张开，显出一扇木门。把手老旧，门牌的位置空着，没有写任何名字。","bg":"tarotDoor","tone":"dark","bgm":"zeroPoint","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"serious"},"c":{"who":"pje","x":"serious"},"r":{"who":"moka","x":"base"},"sfx":"door","scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-45:101","s":"pje","t":"这回门牌空了，连可读的都没有。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:102","s":"moka","t":"那更吓人好不好。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-45:103","s":"n","t":"闰月站到门前，脱下手套。掌心的黑圆向门倾斜，像水往低处流。"},{"id":"ep-45:104","s":"yun","t":"门后和我掌心一样的气味，空空的气味。","x":"pain","im":true,"fx":"suck","sfx":"whoosh","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"suck","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 yun의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:105","s":"yun","t":"是空亡，黑月的家。大概也是猫先生所在的地方。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:106","s":"yeon","t":"那就开。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-45:107","s":"yun","t":"真果断。进去以后，五片天空都会向那里崩塌。做好准备了吗？","x":"sly"},{"id":"ep-45:108","s":"yeon","t":"备忘上写了，想不起来也去。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-45:109","s":"n","t":"Yeoni握住门把，冰凉。这时，门后传来声音，非常轻，却清晰。"},{"id":"ep-45:110","s":"n","t":"「袜子，要穿成一对。」","im":true,"shot":"quiet","sfx":"none","scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-45:111","s":"n","t":"Yeoni的手僵在门把上。她不知道是谁的声音，眼泪却先流了下来。她低头看自己的脚，袜子不成对。"}]}
